[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238365\">5050B34</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238948\">7055A18</a></p><p>1. Remove the motor guard.</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Windscreen wiper motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236985\">N15</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Unscrew.</p><p>4. Remove the windscreen wiper assembly.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018603.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the windscreen wiper\nassembly is not damaged.</p><p>Reaasemble the windscreen wiper assembly.</p><p>Screw.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p>Reinsert the motor guard.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238948\">7055A18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238365\">5050B34</a></p><p>Check the function of the windscreen wiper.</p>"]]